            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "Figure 4 shows the daily simulated and observed discharges at Kyangjing station. Based on these time series a number of model performance indicators were determined; the Nash-Sutcliffe model efficiency coefficient equals 0.76, the Pearson correlation coefficient is 0.87 and the bias is 3%. In addition the calibrated parameters (Table 1) are all in a plausible range. Hence, the model is able to simulate the discharge at the outlet of the catchment realistically and with relatively high accuracy.",
